@host = http://localhost:5157

### Santé
GET {{host}}/health

### Lister / rechercher
GET {{host}}/api/customers?search=dupont&page=1&pageSize=20

### Créer
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jean",
  "lastName": "Dupont",
  "email": "jean.dupont@example.com",
  "phone": "+33 6 12 34 56 78",
  "address": { "street": "1 rue de la Paix", "city": "Paris", "postalCode": "75002", "country": "France" }
}

### Lire
@id = REMPLACER_PAR_UN_ID
GET {{host}}/api/customers/{{id}}

### Modifier
PUT {{host}}/api/customers/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jean",
  "lastName": "Dupont",
  "email": "jean.dupont@example.com",
  "phone": "+33 6 00 00 00 00"
}

### Supprimer
DELETE {{host}}/api/customers/{{id}}
